  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for WeatherWatch', 'description': 'Primary container for WeatherWatch implementation: A simple weather app that allows users to check current weather conditions and forecasts for their location or any searched city. It fetches real-time weather data from a public API and displays temperature, humidity, wind speed, and weather icons.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Current Weather",\n      "description": "Displays the current weather conditions for the user\'s location or a searched city, including temperature, humidity, and weather description.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Weather Forecast",\n      "description": "Shows a 5-day weather forecast with daily high and low temperatures and weather icons.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Location Search",\n      "description": "Allows users to search for weather information by entering a city name.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Geolocation Support",\n      "description": "Automatically detects the user\'s location to show local weather on app launch.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2196F3",\n    "secondary": "#E3F2FD",\n    "accent": "#FFC107"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a clean, card-based layout. At the top, there\'s a search bar for city input. Below, the current weather is displayed in a prominent card with temperature, icon, and details. The forecast is shown in a horizontal scrollable list of cards. The color scheme uses a light background with blue accents for weather elements."\n}'}",
